	(text "Per coil: banana jack (+)  |  2-way screw terminal  |  banana jack (-), all in parallel, in the same order as on the board. Terminal pin 1 = coil +, pin 2 = coil -.\nCoil + comes from H-bridge OUT_A through the current-sense shunt; coil - is H-bridge OUT_B."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e3caa5ad-35c3-4105-88ef-565f6e824f9e")
	)
